{"_v":1,"id":"miss-saigon-1991","cat":"broadway","bd":{"positive":2,"mixed":2,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Frank Rich","o":"The New York Times","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/1991/04/12/theater/review-theater-miss-saigon-arrives-from-the-old-school.html","d":"1991-04-12","q":"This musical is a gripping entertainment of the old school."},{"cn":"Michael Kuchwara","o":"Associated Press","s":76,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.newspapers.com/image/106850798/","d":"1991-05-19","q":"Pryce's sensational performance should put an end to the arguments"},{"cn":"Linda Winer","o":"Newsday","s":66,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.newspapers.com/image/175686626/","d":"1991-04-12","q":"In those shocking couple of seconds, \"Miss Saigon\"—the success and the ferocity of the moment—finally made sense."},{"cn":"Clive Barnes","o":"New York Post","s":69,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.newspapers.com/image/203168235/","d":"1991-04-14","q":"It is engaging. It is insulting. It is never boring."},{"cn":"Howard Kissel","o":"New York Daily News","s":49,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.newspapers.com/image/102127228/","d":"1991-04-13","q":"Apart from some impressive performances, there's not much else to make Miss Saigon worthwhile."}],"au":{"score":84,"designation":"Liking","sources":{"mz":{"s":84,"c":86,"sr":4.2}}},"tn":[{"yr":45,"cat":"Best Actor in a Musical","n":"Jonathan Pryce","w":true},{"yr":45,"cat":"Best Actress in a Musical","n":"Lea Salonga","w":true},{"yr":45,"cat":"Best Featured Actor in a Musical","n":"Hinton Battle","w":true},{"yr":45,"cat":"Best Musical","n":null},{"yr":45,"cat":"Best Book of a Musical","n":"Alain Boublil"},{"yr":45,"cat":"Best Book of a Musical","n":"Claude-Michel Schönberg"},{"yr":45,"cat":"Best Original Score","n":"Alain Boublil"},{"yr":45,"cat":"Best Original Score","n":"Richard Maltby, Jr."},{"yr":45,"cat":"Best Original Score","n":"Claude-Michel Schönberg"},{"yr":45,"cat":"Best Featured Actor in a Musical","n":"Wil